{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04265","headline":"早发淮口望盱眙 · 骆宾王","name":"早发淮口望盱眙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养蒙分四渎，习坎奠三荆。\n徙帝留余地，封王表旧城。\n岸昏涵蜃气，潮满应鸡声。\n洲迥连沙静，川虚积溜明。\n一朝从捧檄，千里倦悬旌。\n背流桐柏远，逗浦木兰轻。\n小山迷隐路，大块切劳生。\n唯有贞心在，独映寒潭清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}